    <string name="faq_q1">How do I post an ad?</string>
    <string name="faq_a1">Tap the “+” button at the bottom, choose a category, add photos, title, price and location, then submit. Your ad goes live after moderation.</string>
    <string name="faq_q2">Why is my ad not visible yet?</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">New ads are reviewed by moderators, usually within 24 hours. You can check the status in “My ads”.</string>
    <string name="faq_q3">Why was my ad rejected?</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">Ads are rejected when they violate the rules — prohibited items, wrong category or misleading information. Edit the ad and it will be reviewed again.</string>
    <string name="faq_q4">How do I promote my ad to the top?</string>
    <string name="faq_a4">Open “My ads”, long-press your ad and choose “Promote to top”, then pay with Payme or Click. Promoted ads appear above others.</string>
    <string name="faq_q5">How do I mark my item as sold?</string>
    <string name="faq_a5">Open “My ads”, long-press the ad and choose “Mark as sold”. You can re-activate it later if needed.</string>
    <string name="faq_q6">Why did my ad expire?</string>
    <string name="faq_a6">Ads expire automatically after 30 days. Open “My ads”, filter by Expired and tap “Re-activate” to publish again.</string>
    <string name="faq_q7">How do I contact a seller?</string>
    <string name="faq_a7">Open the listing and use the Message or Call buttons. All your chats are in the Messages section.</string>
    <string name="faq_q8">How do I delete my account?</string>
    <string name="faq_a8">Open selling.uz/account-deletion in a browser and follow the instructions, or send us a message below.</string>
